# {{.Title}}

A [Tela](https://github.com/kuronosu/tela) app.

```bash
tela dev                       # run it, reloading on every save
CGO_ENABLED=0 go run .         # run it once
CGO_ENABLED=0 go test ./...    # test it without a window
tela snapshot -o app.png .     # render it to a PNG
tela inspect .                 # print what it contains, as text
```

Install the `tela` command once with
`CGO_ENABLED=0 go install github.com/kuronosu/tela/cmd/tela@latest`.

To ship it on Windows without a console window:
`go build -trimpath -ldflags="-H=windowsgui"`.
